<section class="lp-section" id="challenge">
  <!-- LF_CHRISTMAS_EDITORIAL_IMAGE_V1 -->
  <div class="lp-container lp-editorial-grid">
    <div class="lp-editorial-copy">
      <p class="lp-eyebrow">THE REAL PROBLEM</p><h2>Getting the lead is only half the job.</h2>
      <div class="lp-copy">
        <p>During the Christmas rush, teams are on ladders and at installations—not sitting behind a CRM. Prospects may request pricing, put off booking, or need more information before they're ready.</p><p>Without a process, even interested inquiries can end up scattered across forms, texts and inboxes.</p><p><strong>We built the follow-through before scaling the traffic.</strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="lp-editorial-visual">
      <img
        src="/work/christmas-lighting-owner-editorial.jpg"
        alt="Illustration of a Christmas lighting business operator with a tablet outside a professionally decorated home"
        width="1024"
        height="1024"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <figcaption>
        From the first inquiry to the installation schedule.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

    <section class="lp-section lp-soft" id="system"><div class="lp-container"><p class="lp-eyebrow">THE SYSTEM</p><h2>One connected conversion path.</h2><p class="lp-section-lead">A clear experience for the prospect, and useful information for the business.</p><div class="lp-flow" aria-label="Interactive connected lead acquisition journey">{steps.map((s,i) => <button type="button" class="lp-flow-step" data-step={i} aria-pressed={i===0?'true':'false'}><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,"0")}</span><strong>{s}</strong><small>Explore step ↗</small></button>)}</div><div id="lp-step-detail" class="lp-explorer" role="status" aria-live="polite"><strong>01 / Meta Ads &amp; creative</strong><p>Creative angles and campaign architecture were prepared for Cypress before paid acquisition launches.</p></div><div class="lp-actions"><a href={book} class="lp-button lp-track-demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">See this system in a 15-minute demo ↗</a></div></div></section>
    <section class="lp-section" id="details"><div class="lp-container"><p class="lp-eyebrow">BUILT FOR THE FOLLOW-THROUGH</p><h2>The pieces work together—not as separate services.</h2><div class="lp-feature-grid">{features.map(([n,title,description]) => <details class="lp-feature"><summary><span>{n} / SYSTEM COMPONENT</span><h3>{title}</h3><b aria-hidden="true">+</b></summary><p>{description}</p></details>)}</div><p class="lp-hint">Tap a component to see what it does.</p></div></section>
    <section class="lp-section lp-soft"><div class="lp-container lp-two"><div><p class="lp-eyebrow">LEAD PRIORITIZATION</p><h2>Not every lead needs the same follow-up.</h2><p class="lp-section-lead">The Cypress configuration tags quote inquiries by stated budget so the team can identify higher-value opportunities and nurture prospects not yet ready.</p></div><div><div class="lp-tiers">{tiers.map(([price,status],i) => <button type="button" data-tier={i} aria-pressed={i===2?'true':'false'}><strong>{price}</strong><span>{status}</span></button>)}</div><p id="lp-tier-detail" class="lp-explorer lp-tier-explanation" aria-live="polite">$1,200–$2,000 · Good fit: an inquiry in this range can be prioritized for a timely quote conversation.</p></div></div></section>
    <section class="lp-section"><div class="lp-container"><p class="lp-eyebrow">TWO WAYS TO CONVERT</p><h2>Some prospects want a visit. Others just want a quote.</h2><div class="lp-paths"><article class="lp-select-path" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-pressed="true" data-path="0"><span>PATH A</span><h3>Book a design visit</h3><p>Qualified prospects select an available time. Their details carry forward, booking confirmations can go out, and the pipeline reflects the appointment.</p></article><article class="lp-select-path" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-pressed="false" data-path="1"><span>PATH B</span><h3>Request a quote without a visit</h3><p>A prospect can request a remote quote with information already captured. The CRM records the request and alerts the team for property review or additional photos.</p></article></div><p class="lp-callout" id="lp-path-detail" aria-live="polite">Design visit selected: qualification details carry into booking and the CRM, with confirmation and reminder logic.</p><p class="lp-hint">Choose either path to explore how the journey changes.</p></div></section>
    <section class="lp-section lp-ink"><div class="lp-container lp-two"><div><p class="lp-eyebrow">AUTOMATION + TRACKING</p><h2>A next step for every inquiry.</h2><p>Immediate email confirmation, conditional follow-ups, booking stop rules and different messaging for lower-budget prospects were configured for Cypress. SMS sequences were built but await required A2P registration and activation.</p><a href={book} class="lp-button lp-track-demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Walk through the CRM & automations ↗</a></div><div class="lp-dark-stack"><div><span>01</span>New lead → budget and project qualification</div><div><span>02</span>Design visit or remote quote request</div><div><span>03</span>CRM stages, owner assignment and follow-up</div><div><span>04</span>UTMs and Meta campaign/ad identifiers captured</div></div></div></section>
    <section class="lp-section" id="proof"><div class="lp-container lp-two lp-proof"><div><p class="lp-eyebrow">REAL CLIENT IMPLEMENTATION</p><h2>See what we built for Cypress X-Mas Lights.</h2><p>Cypress, Texas · Residential and commercial holiday lighting.</p><p>The live project demonstrates the custom landing page, quote-qualification experience and booking paths. Meta campaign architecture and creative testing were prepared; this page does not claim unverified CPL, booked appointments or revenue.</p><div class="lp-actions"><a href={funnel} class="lp-text-link lp-track-funnel" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open live Cypress funnel ↗</a><a href={book} class="lp-button lp-track-demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book my demo ↗</a></div></div><figure class="lp-project-img"><img src="/work/cypress-christmas-lights.webp" alt="Cypress X-Mas Lights live project screenshot" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></figure></div></section>

    <!-- LF_CHRISTMAS_SEARCH_UPDATE_20261028 -->
 <!-- LF_CHRISTMAS_CONTENT_POLISH_V1 -->
 <section class="lp-section lp-soft lp-search-strategy lp-seasonal-playbook" id="marketing-strategy" aria-labelledby="lp-strategy-heading">
 <div class="lp-container">
 <div class="lp-seasonal-head"><div><p class="lp-eyebrow">YOUR BEST WORK, IN MOTION</p><h2 id="lp-strategy-heading">Make your Christmas lighting installs impossible to scroll past.</h2></div>
 <p>Christmas lighting is a visual service. Let people see the transformation, reach them when they're ready, and make the next step easy.</p></div>
 <div class="lp-seasonal-grid">
 <article class="lp-seasonal-feature"><span>01 / VIDEO + AD CREATIVE</span><h3>Show the transformation, not just the offer.</h3><p>Short-form Reels, before-and-after transformations, edited video ads, attention-grabbing hooks and static creatives help prospective customers picture their own home or business lit up.</p><p class="lp-seasonal-fine">Video editing and creative assets can be tailored to available footage and campaign goals.</p></article>
 <article class="lp-seasonal-feature"><span>02 / BE FOUND AT THE RIGHT MOMENT</span><h3>Capture local demand.</h3><p>Google Ads and local-search messaging can focus on the areas you actually serve, residential or commercial installations, and the projects your team can take on.</p></article>
 <article class="lp-seasonal-feature"><span>03 / PLAN FOR THE SEASON</span><h3>Fill the calendar before the rush.</h3><p>Early-booking campaigns, commercial and HOA outreach, and reactivation of past customers can complement new lead acquisition. Timing follows your crew capacity and market.</p></article>
 </div>
 <div class="lp-seasonal-proof"><div><span>REAL PROJECT: CYPRESS X-MAS LIGHTS</span><strong>See the actual quote funnel, CRM and follow-up setup.</strong><p>Campaign concepts and creative were prepared; we don't claim unverified advertising results or present pending SMS approval as live.</p></div>
 <a class="lp-button lp-track-demo" href="https://calendar.app.google/1fpawLr6fgP7Hmoi7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a 15-minute demo ↗</a></div>
 </div></section>




<section class="lp-section lp-search-faq" id="questions" aria-labelledby="lp-faq-heading"><div class="lp-container lp-search-split"><div><p class="lp-eyebrow">QUESTIONS INSTALLERS ASK</p><h2 id="lp-faq-heading">Christmas lighting lead generation, explained.</h2><p class="lp-section-lead">Helpful answers before you book a walkthrough.</p></div><div class="lp-search-answers">
      <details><summary>What is Christmas light installation marketing?</summary><p>It combines customer acquisition through paid advertising, local search and referrals with quote collection, qualification and follow-up to help installers turn interested homeowners into sales conversations and potential bookings.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How can my Christmas lighting company get more qualified leads?</summary><p>Target your actual service area, set expectations about your offer, and collect project details and approximate budget before the initial conversation. Route leads into a CRM with a clear next step rather than treating every inquiry alike.</p></details>
      <details><summary>When should Christmas light installers start advertising?</summary><p>Prepare campaigns well before installation demand peaks. Early marketing can build awareness, reconnect with previous customers and reach commercial prospects; timing depends on your market and crew capacity.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if a customer wants a quote without a site visit?</summary><p>The Cypress system offers a remote-quote path that reuses details already collected. The team can review the property and request additional photos when appropriate.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Does the system include SMS and email automation?</summary><p>The Cypress implementation includes email follow-up and booking-status rules. SMS workflows were configured but await required registration and activation; they are not presented as live.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Are these shared Christmas light installation leads?</summary><p>No. LeadsFlo builds a brand-specific acquisition and follow-up system. It is not a marketplace selling the same inquiry to several installers, and it does not promise a fixed volume of jobs.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I see a real Christmas lighting example?</summary><p>Yes. The live Cypress X-Mas Lights funnel in Texas demonstrates quote qualification, booking and remote-quote paths, CRM routing and attribution fields. The 15-minute demo walks through that implementation.</p></details>
    </div></div></section>
<section class="lp-final" id="book"><div class="lp-container"><p class="lp-eyebrow">FOR CHRISTMAS LIGHTING COMPANIES</p><h2>Want to see exactly how this could work for your business?</h2><p>I'll show you the Cypress quote funnel, CRM, lead qualification, follow-up and tracking in a focused 15-minute walkthrough.</p><a href={book} class="lp-button lp-button-lime lp-track-demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book my 15-minute demo ↗</a><small>No long presentation. You'll see the actual system.</small></div></section>

